{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossroads will drop you deep into the earth to explore what lays below. With only a few memories intact, embark on a gruelling adventure through caves, mines, sewers, and dungeons on a mission to get back home to your daughter. Reunite with a long lost friend and rediscovered the memories of who you both were. Only then might you fully understand why you're down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your revolver isn't just a weapon, it's a tool for mobility!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, gun, and fly with this powerful hand cannon. Defy the laws of gravity to navigate the in game environments and to tackle even the mightiest of foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/extras/9aaa2663514a67b6183ce276a7cad651.poster.avif?t=1761331134\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/extras/9aaa2663514a67b6183ce276a7cad651.webm?t=1761331134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/extras/9aaa2663514a67b6183ce276a7cad651.mp4?t=1761331134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the inhabitants of this world!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with friends and foes alike to learn more about your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/extras/885b2f426aacec734080ccc164496da7.avif?t=1761331134\" width=394 height=758 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now meet the monsters!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures that stand between you and your adventure, from bats, rats, snakes, and bandits to the monsters that lurk in the vents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/extras/ed2d5ef62da3d51cae6d95ed4bd6052a.poster.avif?t=1761331134\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/extras/ed2d5ef62da3d51cae6d95ed4bd6052a.webm?t=1761331134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/extras/ed2d5ef62da3d51cae6d95ed4bd6052a.mp4?t=1761331134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975460?t=1761331134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/16fe7aa861d2ad6424b744a16d44109618ff7e95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761331134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/30308ca6cedb19bd2cd81fccfb7a1c3323780d44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761331134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975460/30308ca6cedb19bd2cd81fccfb7a1c3323780d44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761331134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragr